category: Libs
requires: cygwin-devel libcglm0 pkg-config
sdesc: "Optimized OpenGL/Graphics Math (glm) for C (development)"
ldesc: "cglm is an optimized 3D math library written in C99 (compatible with C89). It
is similar to the original glm library, except cglm is mainly for C."
external-source: cglm

